xtras/4f5232b1dcb367a2efcbcb1b86475682.poster.avif?t=1751585393\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/4f5232b1dcb367a2efcbcb1b86475682.webm?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/4f5232b1dcb367a2efcbcb1b86475682.mp4?t=1751585393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 LIVERY EDITOR &amp;  SHOWROOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design custom bikes, suits, and helmets in full VR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcf8 PHOTO &amp; REPLAY TOOLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pause time mid-race, fly through your replay, and capture your best moments from any angle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668430/extras/f134fec42a84fafb81da32efa00319ca.avif?t=1751585393\" /></div>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
